1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
I look around the waiting room, I see the little kids

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,460
I see the mothers crying, and then I look inside myself

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:09,860
And tell the Lord above

4
00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:13,220
That I would rather die

5
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:18,420
Than let another innocent person endure the burden of this burning hell

6
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:20,260
Give me the sickness, give me the weakness

7
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:23,860
I will be the witness who fell and stood right back up on his feet

8
00:00:23,860 --> 00:00:25,780
Refusing defeat, completing the treatment

9
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,680
I'm deleting the grievance, achieving a grievance-free state of achievement
